<view class="ep-page">

  <view class="ep-head anim-stage-rise">
    <view class="head-tapes">
      <text class="tape tape-stamped">{{isRegister ? 'PROFILE · 注册' : 'PROFILE · 编辑'}}</text>
    </view>
    <text class="head-title">{{isRegister ? '注册' : '编辑资料'}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="ep-form anim-stage-rise anim-delay-1">
    <view class="form-item form-item-avatar">
      <view class="field-label">
        <text class="num field-num">01</text>
        <text class="field-text">头像 <text class="optional">(选填)</text></text>
      </view>
      <button
        class="avatar-row tap-scale"
        bindtap="onAvatarActionTap"
        disabled="{{avatarUploading}}"
        loading="{{avatarUploading}}"
      >
        <view class="avatar-wrap">
          <image class="avatar-img" src="{{avatarPreviewUrl || formData.avatarUrl || defaultAvatar}}" mode="aspectFill" />
        </view>
        <view class="avatar-meta">
          <text class="avatar-meta-label">CHANGE</text>
          <text class="avatar-meta-val">{{avatarUploading ? '上传中...' : '点击更换 →'}}</text>
        </view>
      </button>
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="field-label">
        <text class="num field-num">02</text>
        <text class="field-text">昵称 <text class="required">*</text></text>
      </view>
      <input
        class="form-input"
        type="text"
        placeholder="请输入昵称"
        placeholder-class="form-placeholder"
        value="{{formData.name}}"
        bindinput="onNameInput"
        maxlength="20"
        confirm-type="done"
        cursor-spacing="24"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="field-label">
        <text class="num field-num">03</text>
        <text class="field-text">打法 <text wx:if="{{isRegister}}" class="required">*</text><text wx:else class="optional">(选填)</text></text>
      </view>
      <radio-group class="play-style-group" bindchange="onPlayStyleChange">
        <label class="ps-radio" wx:for="{{playStyleOptions}}" wx:key="value">
          <radio value="{{item.value}}" checked="{{formData.playStyle === item.value}}" />
          <text class="ps-radio-label">{{item.label}}</text>
        </label>
      </radio-group>
    </view>

  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{needsAgreement}}" class="agreement-panel anim-stage-rise anim-delay-2">
    <view class="agreement-row">
      <checkbox-group class="agreement-check" bindchange="onAgreementChange">
        <checkbox value="accepted" checked="{{agreementAccepted}}" color="#0B0C09" />
      </checkbox-group>
      <view class="agreement-copy">
        <text>我已阅读并同意</text>
        <text class="agreement-link" bindtap="onOpenUserAgreement">《用户服务协议》</text>
        <text>和</text>
        <text class="agreement-link" bindtap="onOpenPrivacyPolicy">《隐私政策》</text>
        <text>，知晓平台将为注册、报名、赛程和成绩统计处理必要的昵称、头像、打法、报名记录、比赛成绩、积分和排行。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="agreement-panel anim-stage-rise anim-delay-2">
    <view class="agreement-row">
      <checkbox-group class="agreement-check" bindchange="onPublicProfileConsentChange">
        <checkbox value="publicProfile" checked="{{publicProfileConsent}}" color="#0B0C09" />
      </checkbox-group>
      <view class="agreement-copy">
        <text>公开展示我的昵称、头像和打法，并在排行榜、球员详情、周星、H2H、近期比赛和赛事页展示报名状态、比赛成绩、积分和排行。</text>
        <text>未勾选时，上述公开页面将以匿名身份展示，注册、报名、赛程和成绩统计仍可正常使用。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="ep-footer">
    <view wx:if="{{!isRegister}}" class="footer-btn footer-btn-ghost tap-scale" bindtap="onCancel">取消</view>
    <view class="footer-btn footer-btn-primary tap-scale {{needsAgreement && !agreementAccepted ? 'footer-btn-disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="onSave">{{isRegister ? '完成注册' : '保存'}}</view>
  </view>

</view>
